==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is possible, and rather easy, to beat this stage by spamming lv 20 [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe]] and [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja]] Cat.

